    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d471">

                <pb facs="0697" n="623" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg623"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Tassara.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 7, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Recurring to the subject of the Meteor, the undersigned, Secretary of State of
                    the United States, has the honor to enclose herewith, for the information of <pb
                        facs="0698" n="624" xml:id="pg624"/> Mr. Tassara, a copy of a letter of the
                    4th instant from the Attorney General of the United States.</p>
                <p>The undersigned offers to Mr. Tassara renewed assurances of his high
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor Don <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gabriel Garcia y Tassara</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
